    "paragraph": "An Iterated Local Search algorithm was developed to optimize stationary and dynamic inductive charging locations and flexible route detours for electric transit shuttles. Researchers evaluated public perceptions of urban liveability across seven domains using an interactive, yarn-based installation during Malta's Science in the City festival. Another study combined GIS spatial analysis and machine learning in a Learning-Based Multi-Criteria Decision-Making framework to determine sawmill site suitability across Mississippi.",
